  "limitations": [
    "The payer and the seller are one key. `generate_apass` returns 403 for this credential (ASM-035), so no second A-Passed identity exists and both intent signatures come from one wallet. Each leg still moves value into and out of a settlement contract; conservation is proven at the escrow balance and at the reservation rather than at a wallet delta.",
    "The wallet is a real key signing real payloads through an EIP-1193 provider Playwright can drive. A browser extension cannot be automated, so the extension UI itself is covered by a manual smoke test rather than by this run."
  ]
